WEBVTT

00:01.225 --> 00:04.158
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

00:04.225 --> 00:09.658
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

00:09.725 --> 00:11.158
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

00:11.225 --> 00:13.058
[customers snoring, groaning]
[顾客打鼾、呻吟]

00:13.125 --> 00:15.525
- Just go!
- Oh, no.
- 走吧！
- 哦，不。

00:15.558 --> 00:18.191
- Yes, I will have
a quad patty,
- 是的，我会有
四块肉饼，

00:18.258 --> 00:20.158
with a sprinkling
of Himalayan salt,
洒
喜马拉雅盐，

00:20.225 --> 00:23.658
smoked paprika,
and micro greens.
烟熏辣椒粉，
和微型果岭。

00:23.725 --> 00:26.058
- Gimme a quad--
- Hold on.
- 给我一个四边形 -
- 等一下。

00:26.125 --> 00:28.791
I'm not finished with my order.
我的订单还没完成。

00:28.858 --> 00:31.658
customers: Aw, come on!
顾客：噢，来吧！

00:31.725 --> 00:34.258
- I would like my patties
be-cheesed,
- 我想要我的肉饼
干酪，

00:34.325 --> 00:36.525
but not just any cheese will do.
但并非任何奶酪都可以。

00:36.558 --> 00:38.525
Have you any aged "how-uda"?
你有老年“how-uda”吗？

00:38.558 --> 00:39.858
[customers grumbling]
And yes,
[顾客抱怨]
是的，

00:39.925 --> 00:41.258
it is pronounced "how-uda,"
它的发音是“how-uda”

00:41.325 --> 00:43.191
not "goo-da."
- [growling]
不是“好达”。
- [咆哮]

00:43.258 --> 00:45.258
Just eat the regular
Krabby Patty
吃普通的就可以了
蟹肉饼

00:45.325 --> 00:47.558
and stop wasting
everybody's time!
并停止浪费
每个人的时间！

00:47.625 --> 00:48.925
- Mr. Krabs!
- 蟹老板！

00:48.991 --> 00:51.291
You know we don't
treat our customers like that.
你知道我们不
像这样对待我们的客户。

00:51.358 --> 00:52.758
[ascending xylophone notes]
[上升木琴音符]

00:52.825 --> 00:54.658
It says right here,
in the Krusty Krab manual.
就在这里说，
在蟹堡王手册中。

00:54.725 --> 00:57.525
[clears throat]
"The customer is always right,
[清嗓子]
“顾客永远是对的，

00:57.525 --> 00:59.425
when they have money."
- Oh!
当他们有钱的时候。”
- 哦！

00:59.525 --> 01:01.525
Such wise and beautiful words.
如此智慧而美丽的话语。

01:01.558 --> 01:03.325
Thanks for reminding me,
SpongeBob.
谢谢你提醒我，
海绵宝宝。

01:03.391 --> 01:05.325
- I'm here to serve,
Mr. Krabs.
- 我来这里是为了服务，
蟹老板。

01:05.391 --> 01:07.658
[soars, splats]
[飞翔，啪啪]

01:07.725 --> 01:11.791
- [growsl, screams]
Ketchup waster!
- [咆哮，尖叫]
浪费番茄酱！

01:11.858 --> 01:13.191
- [whimpers]
- [呜咽]

01:13.258 --> 01:15.625
- Oh!
Sorry, SpongeBob.
- 哦！
对不起，海绵宝宝。

01:15.691 --> 01:18.225
I didn't mean it.
No more outbursts.
我不是故意的。
不再爆发。

01:18.291 --> 01:20.591
I'll be nice Mr. Krabs,
I promise.
我会很好的蟹蟹先生
我保证。

01:20.658 --> 01:23.125
- Your napkin.
- [grunts]
- 你的餐巾。
- [咕哝]

01:23.191 --> 01:24.791
- [growling]
- [咆哮]

01:24.858 --> 01:27.091
Waster!
浪费！

01:27.158 --> 01:28.625
[panicked music]
[惊慌的音乐]

01:28.691 --> 01:31.325
[shouting incoherently]
[语无伦次地喊叫]

01:31.391 --> 01:33.091
- [shouts, pants]
- Hmm?
- [喊叫，裤子]
- 嗯？

01:33.158 --> 01:35.691
Ow!
Mr. Krabs!
噢！
蟹老板！

01:35.758 --> 01:37.858
You gotta calm down!
- [shouting incoherently]
你必须冷静！
- [语无伦次地喊叫]

01:37.925 --> 01:40.958
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

01:45.325 --> 01:46.991
- [struggling]
- [挣扎]

01:47.058 --> 01:48.925
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

01:48.991 --> 01:50.691
- Oh!
- [shouting]
- 哦！
- [喊叫]

01:50.758 --> 01:51.658
[yelps]
[尖叫声]

01:51.725 --> 01:52.958
[shouting]
- [growls]
[喊叫]
- [咆哮]

01:53.025 --> 01:54.591
I'll murder-lize him!
我要杀了他！

01:54.658 --> 01:56.558
- Relax, little crab guy.
- 放松点，小螃蟹家伙。

01:56.625 --> 01:59.758
- [growling]
Get your muscled mitts off me!
- [咆哮]
把你肌肉发达的手套从我身上拿开！

01:59.825 --> 02:01.125
Get off!
下车！

02:01.191 --> 02:03.358
Get...
[sighs happily]
得到...
[高兴地叹气]

02:03.425 --> 02:07.191
That's right.
Give in to the healing power
这是正确的。
屈服于治愈的力量

02:07.258 --> 02:10.658
of my pecs.
- I feel so secure.
我的胸肌。
- 我感觉很安全。

02:10.725 --> 02:12.525
- [sighs]
All better?
- [叹气]
一切都好些了吗？

02:12.558 --> 02:14.091
- What?
You let him go?
- 什么？
你让他走了？

02:14.158 --> 02:16.058
We're all dead!
[shouting]
我们都死了！
[喊叫]

02:16.125 --> 02:17.525
[shouts, struggles]
[喊叫、挣扎]

02:17.558 --> 02:19.425
[sizzling]
Ow!
[嘶嘶声]
噢！

02:19.525 --> 02:21.691
The grill's still on!
烤架还开着！

02:21.758 --> 02:23.725
[shouting]
[喊叫]

02:23.791 --> 02:25.658
[wailing]
[哀号]

02:25.725 --> 02:26.758
[grunts]
[咕哝]

02:26.825 --> 02:28.825
- I don't know
what's wrong with me.
- 我不知道
我怎么了。

02:28.891 --> 02:31.158
The Krusty Krab's
just been so busy.
蟹堡王店
只是太忙了。

02:31.225 --> 02:32.791
I never seem to get a break.
我似乎从来没有休息过。

02:32.858 --> 02:35.225
- Sounds like someone
needs a vacation.
- 听起来像某人
需要休假。

02:35.291 --> 02:37.691
- I--I could use
some me time.
- 我--我可以使用
一些我的时间。

02:37.758 --> 02:39.891
- And don't worry.
Squidward and I can take care
- 别担心。
章鱼哥和我可以照顾

02:39.958 --> 02:41.691
of the Krusty Krab
while you're gone.
蟹堡王的
当你离开的时候。

02:41.758 --> 02:42.691
- Hmm...
- 唔...

02:42.758 --> 02:43.958
[terrifying string music]
[恐怖的弦乐]

02:44.025 --> 02:46.525
- Order up!
- 订购吧！

02:46.525 --> 02:48.258
- [screams]
I'm sorry,
- [尖叫]
对不起，

02:48.325 --> 02:50.025
but I can't leave
you guys in charge.
但我不能离开
你们负责。

02:50.091 --> 02:52.525
I need a strong man
to run this place--
我需要一个坚强的男人
经营这个地方——

02:52.591 --> 02:53.991
someone who's a rock
坚如磐石的人

02:54.058 --> 02:55.825
and can really handle the load,
you know?
并且能够真正承受负载，
你知道吗？

02:55.891 --> 02:58.925
But who has
that kind of strength, hmm?
但谁有
那种力量，嗯？

02:58.991 --> 03:02.525
- Psst, psst!
[stammers excitedly]
- 嘘，嘘！
[兴奋地结巴]

03:02.558 --> 03:03.991
- That's it!
Larry,
- 就是这样！
拉里，

03:04.058 --> 03:06.591
how would you like
to manage the Krusty Krab
你想要怎样
管理蟹堡王

03:06.658 --> 03:08.291
while I'm on vacation?
当我在度假的时候？

03:08.358 --> 03:10.525
- Larry's got
his own gym to run.
- 拉里有
他自己的健身房去经营。

03:10.591 --> 03:12.225
- Come on, Larry.
It'll be fun.
- 来吧，拉里。
会很有趣的。

03:12.291 --> 03:15.025
- Larry loves fun!
I'm in.
- 拉里喜欢玩乐！
我进来了

03:15.091 --> 03:16.091
- All right!
- 好的！

03:16.158 --> 03:17.758
Ah!
- [groans]
啊!
- [呻吟]

03:17.825 --> 03:18.558
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

03:18.625 --> 03:20.091
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

03:20.158 --> 03:23.058
- Oh, hey, Larry.
How you liking your new job?
- 哦，嘿，拉里。
你喜欢你的新工作吗？

03:23.125 --> 03:24.658
- Larry likes it just fine.
- 拉里很喜欢。

03:24.725 --> 03:28.025
But do the customers
always eat like this?
但顾客们是否
总是这样吃吗？

03:28.091 --> 03:31.091
[all chomping obnoxiously]
[都令人讨厌地咀嚼着]

03:31.925 --> 03:34.658
- Oh, no.
They normally eat like this!
- 哦，不。
平时他们都是这样吃的！

03:34.725 --> 03:39.958
[grunting, chomping]
[咕噜声，咀嚼声]

03:40.025 --> 03:41.691
- Those poor people.
- 那些可怜的人。

03:41.758 --> 03:44.625
Someone needs to whip them
into shape.
需要有人鞭打他们
成形。

03:46.958 --> 03:48.025
[meat squelching]
【绞肉】

03:48.091 --> 03:49.325
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

03:49.391 --> 03:51.558
- What'll you have?
- Uh...
- 你要什么？
- 呃...

03:51.625 --> 03:54.858
I'll have a double Krabby Patty,
Krabby fries,
我要一份双层蟹肉饼
蟹黄薯条，

03:54.925 --> 03:55.858
and, uh--whoa!
而且，呃——哇！

03:55.925 --> 03:57.758
- [grunts]
- What else?
- [咕哝]
- 还有什么？

03:57.825 --> 04:00.258
- Uh, uh--
a Krabby soda...
- 呃，呃--
蟹黄苏打水...

04:00.325 --> 04:02.158
Uh, uh--
a Krabby...
呃，呃——
一个蟹蟹...

04:02.225 --> 04:03.925
[debris clatters]
My leg!
[碎片碰撞声]
我的腿！

04:03.991 --> 04:06.791
- [laughs]
Hey!
- [笑]
嘿！

04:06.858 --> 04:09.658
[voice warbling]
Can I help you?
[声音颤抖]
我可以帮你吗？

04:09.725 --> 04:11.558
- Yeah, I'll take
a Krabby salad,
- 是的，我会接受
蟹黄沙拉，

04:11.625 --> 04:13.658
dressing on the side,
and 60 more minutes
一边穿衣服，
还有 60 分钟

04:13.725 --> 04:15.858
on this rad treadmill.
在这个拉德跑步机上。

04:15.925 --> 04:18.625
- [warbling]
Here's your change.
- [颤音]
这是你的零钱。

04:18.691 --> 04:21.125
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

04:21.191 --> 04:22.791
- Here's your order, sir.
- 这是您的命令，先生。

04:22.858 --> 04:24.425
- [struggles]
- And don't forget
- [挣扎]
- 别忘了

04:24.525 --> 04:25.525
your side salad!
你的配菜沙拉！

04:25.591 --> 04:27.858
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

04:27.925 --> 04:30.525
- Yeah!
Push it, push it!
- 是的！
推啊推啊！

04:30.591 --> 04:32.425
- Push it, push it!
- 推它，推它！

04:32.525 --> 04:34.925
- [grunts]
Okay, okay.
- [咕哝]
好吧，好吧。

04:34.991 --> 04:36.958
I'll push it.
[grunting]
我来推一下
[咕噜声]

04:37.025 --> 04:39.091
- Push it, push it!
- Yeah, push it!
- 推它，推它！
- 是的，推它！

04:39.158 --> 04:40.425
- [grunting, sighs]
- [咕哝，叹气]

04:40.525 --> 04:42.125
- Yes!
You made it!
- 是的！
你成功了！

04:42.191 --> 04:44.191
Now, claim
your Krabby Patty!
现在，索赔
你的蟹肉饼！

04:44.258 --> 04:45.525
- [weakly]
Hooray...
- [微弱]
万岁...

04:45.525 --> 04:47.125
[snores]
- Aww, too pooped
[打鼾]
- 哇哦，太拉屎了

04:47.191 --> 04:48.225
for a Krabby Patty.
蟹肉饼。

04:48.291 --> 04:49.691
- Ah, forget Krabby Patties.
- 啊，忘了蟹肉饼吧。

04:49.758 --> 04:51.791
Those things are over.
- But Larry,
那些事情都结束了。
- 但是拉里，

04:51.858 --> 04:53.625
Krabby Patties are why
people come here.
蟹肉饼是为什么
人们来到这里。

04:53.691 --> 04:56.858
- Ooh, not anymore.
Now we only serve salads
- 哦，不再是了。
现在我们只提供沙拉

04:56.925 --> 04:59.258
and protein power shakes!
和蛋白质能量奶昔！

04:59.325 --> 05:01.725
- Ooh, power shake!
I wanna taste.
- 哦，权力震动！
我想尝尝。

05:01.791 --> 05:03.191
[slurps]
[啜饮]

05:03.258 --> 05:05.291
[grunts, spits]
[咕哝声，吐口水]

05:05.358 --> 05:07.391
[pants]
[裤子]

05:07.525 --> 05:09.358
- You like?
- No, Larry.
- 你喜欢吗？
- 不，拉里。

05:09.425 --> 05:11.591
No.
- But it gets you jacked!
不。
- 但这会让你被骗！

05:11.658 --> 05:13.525
- I don't wanna be jacked.
- 我不想被骗。

05:13.525 --> 05:15.658
I just want
my Krabby Patties back.
我只想
我的蟹黄饼回来了。

05:15.725 --> 05:19.191
- Everybody wants to get jacked.
- Yeah, jacked!
- 每个人都想被骗。
- 是啊，被骗了！

05:19.258 --> 05:22.191
[both grunting forcefully]
[两人都用力咕哝]

05:22.258 --> 05:25.191
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

05:25.258 --> 05:26.691
- Look, Larry,
I really think
- 看，拉里，
我真的认为

05:26.758 --> 05:28.658
we should go back
to serving Krabby Patties.
我们应该回去
供应蟹黄肉饼。

05:28.725 --> 05:30.858
People love the...
- [exhales]
人们喜欢...
- [呼气]

05:30.925 --> 05:33.591
- Larry?
- [stammers] Jacked.
- 拉里？
- [结巴] 被劫持了。

05:33.658 --> 05:36.258
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

05:36.325 --> 05:39.558
[customers whimpering]
[顾客呜咽]

05:40.291 --> 05:41.925
- SpongeBob!
- 海绵宝宝！

05:41.991 --> 05:44.091
Squidward!
Let's move it, boys.
章鱼哥！
让我们移动它吧，孩子们。

05:44.158 --> 05:47.158
Get those power shakes out
and those heart rates up!
消除那些权力动摇
心率上升！

05:47.225 --> 05:48.358
[both panting fearfully]
[两人都惊恐地喘着气]

05:48.425 --> 05:51.225
- [babbling weakly]
- [微弱地胡言乱语]

05:51.291 --> 05:53.025
[grunts, shouts]
- Sorry!
[咕哝声，喊叫声]
- 对不起！

05:53.091 --> 05:54.691
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

05:54.758 --> 05:57.391
[shouts]
- [laughing]
[喊叫]
- [笑]

05:57.525 --> 05:59.258
- Whoa!
- [struggling]
- 哇！
- [挣扎]

05:59.325 --> 06:01.125
- [slurps, sighs]
- Oh!
- [啜饮，叹气]
- 哦！

06:01.191 --> 06:03.125
- Horrible sustenance.
- 可怕的食物。

06:03.191 --> 06:06.325
- [whimpering]
- [呜咽]

06:06.391 --> 06:08.125
- [shouts, grunts]
- [喊叫声，咕哝声]

06:08.191 --> 06:10.691
[groaning, grunting]
[呻吟，咕哝]

06:10.758 --> 06:12.791
- Let's get outta here!
- 我们离开这里吧！

06:12.858 --> 06:14.258
- Pardon my reach.
-请原谅我的触及范围。

06:14.325 --> 06:16.525
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

06:16.591 --> 06:19.225
[both struggling]
Go on without me!
[双方都在挣扎]
没有我就继续吧！

06:19.291 --> 06:21.525
- [whimpers, shouts]
- No, wait, don't.
- [呜咽，喊叫]
- 不，等等，不要。

06:21.525 --> 06:23.525
- Squidward,
I know Larry means well,
- 章鱼哥，
我知道拉里的本意是好的

06:23.558 --> 06:25.191
but he's messing up
the Krusty Krab!
但他搞砸了
蟹堡王！

06:25.258 --> 06:28.625
This used to be a shrine
to the delicious Krabby Patty.
这里曾经是一座神社
美味的蟹肉饼。

06:28.691 --> 06:30.725
Now it's just a stinky gym.
现在只是一个臭气熏天的健身房。

06:30.791 --> 06:33.358
- Feel...the...burn!
- 感受……燃烧！

06:33.425 --> 06:34.625
[rock music]
[摇滚乐]

06:34.691 --> 06:36.258
- [struggling]
- [挣扎]

06:36.325 --> 06:37.725
[shouts]
[喊叫]

06:37.791 --> 06:39.525
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

06:39.591 --> 06:41.591
- Squidward,
go tell Larry he's fired.
- 章鱼哥，
去告诉拉里他被解雇了。

06:41.658 --> 06:44.625
- Are you crazy?
He is way too big for that.
- 你疯了？
他太大了，做不到这一点。

06:44.691 --> 06:46.525
We need to come at this
another way--
我们需要解决这个问题
另一种方式——

06:46.558 --> 06:48.091
a smart, dignified way!
聪明、有尊严的方式！

06:48.158 --> 06:50.625
I know--
We'll sabotage the place.
我知道——
我们会破坏这个地方。

06:50.691 --> 06:53.425
- [slurping]
- [发出声音]

06:53.525 --> 06:55.658
- And I know
just where to start:
- 我知道
从哪里开始：

06:55.725 --> 06:58.158
the power shakes.
- I'm on it!
力量震动。
- 我来了！

06:58.225 --> 07:00.191
[giggles]
- Wait, wait--what about me?
[咯咯笑]
- 等等，等等——那我呢？

07:00.258 --> 07:01.791
- [singing]
- [唱歌]

07:01.858 --> 07:04.691
Butter!
Lard!
黄油！
猪油！

07:04.758 --> 07:07.291
Mayonnaise.
[grunts happily]
蛋黄酱。
[高兴地咕哝]

07:07.358 --> 07:09.225
[beachy music]
[海滩音乐]

07:09.291 --> 07:14.625
[blender whirring]
[搅拌机嗡嗡作响]

07:14.691 --> 07:17.391
And now, fry it all up
into a greasy,
现在，把它全部炒起来
变成油腻的，

07:17.525 --> 07:20.225
heart-stopping surprise!
令人心碎的惊喜！

07:20.291 --> 07:21.225
Here you go.
干得好。

07:21.291 --> 07:26.158
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

07:26.225 --> 07:28.758
- I'm loving
this oily concoction.
- 我很爱
这种油腻的混合物。

07:28.825 --> 07:32.358
It really makes
Larry's muscles pop!
确实让
拉里的肌肉爆了！

07:32.425 --> 07:34.591
[grunting forcefully]
[用力咕哝]

07:34.658 --> 07:36.625
- [stifles shout]
- Thanks, SpongeBob.
- [窒息喊叫]
- 谢谢，海绵宝宝。

07:36.691 --> 07:39.391
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

07:41.125 --> 07:42.891
Okay, that failed.
What now?
好吧，失败了。
现在怎么办？

07:42.958 --> 07:44.925
- We'll sabotage
the weight machines.
- 我们会破坏
举重机。

07:44.991 --> 07:47.758
Then these muscle heads will
have to find a new place
然后这些肌肉头就会
必须找到一个新地方

07:47.825 --> 07:49.825
to work out!
- Gotcha.
锻炼身体！
- 明白了。

07:49.891 --> 07:52.091
- Wait, you idiot!
Get me out of here.
- 等等，你这个白痴！
带我离开这里。

07:52.158 --> 07:59.191
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

08:01.725 --> 08:04.025
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

08:04.091 --> 08:05.091
[shouts]
[喊叫]

08:05.158 --> 08:08.025
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

08:08.091 --> 08:09.525
[shouting]
[喊叫]

08:09.591 --> 08:13.325
[growls, shouts]
[咆哮，喊叫]

08:13.391 --> 08:15.358
Awesome workout, bro!
锻炼得真棒，兄弟！

08:15.425 --> 08:16.991
[defeated music]
[败乐]

08:17.058 --> 08:18.758
- Oh, I don't know what to do.
- 哦，我不知道该怎么办。

08:18.825 --> 08:21.558
I guess this place belongs
to the gym guys now.
我想这个地方属于
现在去健身房吧。

08:21.625 --> 08:24.458
- Don't leave me, SpongeBob!
- 别离开我，海绵宝宝！

08:24.525 --> 08:25.758
Wait, what am I saying?
等等，我在说什么？

08:25.825 --> 08:27.558
- Help us!
- 帮助我们！

08:27.625 --> 08:29.858
[customers groaning]
- Hungry!
[顾客呻吟]
- 饿了！

08:29.925 --> 08:32.891
- [chomping manically]
- [疯狂地咀嚼]

08:32.958 --> 08:34.691
- What are you all
doing out here?
-你们都是什么人
在这里做什么？

08:34.758 --> 08:36.291
You should just go home.
你应该回家了。

08:36.358 --> 08:37.558
- We can't go home.
- 我们不能回家。

08:37.625 --> 08:39.591
There's no Krabby Patties
at home.
没有蟹肉饼
在家里。

08:39.658 --> 08:41.658
I need my Krabby Patties, man!
我需要我的蟹肉饼，伙计！

08:41.725 --> 08:43.825
[wailing]
You gotta help me!
[哀号]
你得帮帮我！

08:43.891 --> 08:45.758
- Help us!
- Help, help!
- 帮助我们！
- 救命，救命！

08:45.825 --> 08:47.591
- Krabby Patties--that's it!
- 蟹黄饼——就是这样！

08:47.658 --> 08:51.158
Those gym guys have forgotten
the simple, greasy pleasure
那些健身的人都忘记了
简单、油腻的快乐

08:51.225 --> 08:54.691
of munching on a Krabby Patty,
and we need to remind them.
咀嚼蟹黄饼，
我们需要提醒他们。

08:54.758 --> 08:55.925
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

08:55.991 --> 08:57.525
[all grunting forcefully]
[所有人都用力咕哝]

08:57.591 --> 08:58.925
[thud]
- Huh?
[砰]
- 啊？

08:58.991 --> 09:01.491
surfer music]
冲浪者音乐]

09:01.558 --> 09:04.291
[customers grumbling angrily]
[顾客愤怒地抱怨]

09:04.358 --> 09:08.291
- SpongeBob, you're ruining
Larry's pump sesh.
- 海绵宝宝，你毁了
拉里的泵塞什。

09:08.358 --> 09:11.525
- Larry, you're ruining
the Krusty Krab!
- 拉里，你毁了
蟹堡王！

09:11.558 --> 09:12.725
- Get 'em, men!
- 抓住他们，伙计们！

09:12.791 --> 09:14.258
both: [growling]
两人：[咆哮]

09:14.325 --> 09:15.525
- Fire!
- 火！

09:15.558 --> 09:17.525
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

09:17.525 --> 09:18.991
[together]
Mmm!
[一起]
嗯！

09:19.058 --> 09:21.125
- [grunts]
Get over here!
- [咕哝]
过来这里！

09:22.658 --> 09:24.858
- Mmm.
Oh, gimme, gimme!
- 嗯。
哦，给我，给我！

09:24.925 --> 09:26.625
[munching]
[咀嚼]

09:26.691 --> 09:28.058
- Give him a single!
- 给他一张单曲！

09:28.125 --> 09:30.191
Give him a double with cheese!
给他一份双份奶酪！

09:30.258 --> 09:31.225
[grunts]
[咕哝]

09:31.291 --> 09:33.225
[tranquil music]
[安静的音乐]

09:33.291 --> 09:35.591
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

09:35.658 --> 09:37.225
- Yeah!
- 是的！

09:37.291 --> 09:38.525
[jazzy music]
[爵士乐]

09:38.558 --> 09:41.658
all: Huh?
[munching]
全体：啊？
[咀嚼]

09:41.725 --> 09:44.091
- Give into the flavor, Larry!
- 尝尝味道吧，拉里！

09:44.158 --> 09:46.391
[metal clanking]
- Never!
[金属叮当作响]
- 从来没有！

09:46.525 --> 09:48.658
- He's too fast.
We need a distraction.
- 他太快了。
我们需要分散注意力。

09:48.725 --> 09:51.625
[grunts]
Here, use this.
[咕哝]
在这里，用这个。

09:51.691 --> 09:53.025
- [grunts weakly]
- [微弱地咕哝]

09:53.091 --> 09:55.558
- No, you gotta keep
your elbow--
- 不，你必须保留
你的肘部——

09:55.625 --> 09:57.025
[munching]
[咀嚼]

09:57.091 --> 09:58.658
[tranquil music]
- [exhales]
[安静的音乐]
- [呼气]

09:58.725 --> 10:02.391
- [swallows] Oh!
Greasy, fatty,
- [吞咽]哦！
油腻的，肥腻的，

10:02.525 --> 10:05.725
sticky, and gummy!
It's delicious!
又粘又粘！
真好吃！

10:05.791 --> 10:07.525
Larry's been a fool.
拉里是个傻瓜。

10:07.525 --> 10:09.691
I've spent all my time
working on my muscles
我已经用尽我所有的时间
锻炼我的肌肉

10:09.758 --> 10:13.158
when I could've been working
on these delicious sandwiches.
当我可以工作的时候
在这些美味的三明治上。

10:13.225 --> 10:15.091
[sobbing softly]
What's--
[轻声抽泣]
什么是——

10:15.158 --> 10:18.825
what's wrong with me?
我怎么了？

10:18.891 --> 10:24.025
- Now those
are some sad pecs.
- 现在那些
是一些悲伤的胸肌。

10:24.091 --> 10:26.558
- Aw, don't be sad, Larry.
You were just trying
- 哦，别伤心，拉里。
你只是在尝试

10:26.625 --> 10:28.525
to help people get into shape.
帮助人们塑身。

10:28.558 --> 10:30.525
- [blows snot]
- [流鼻涕]

10:30.591 --> 10:32.958
[all chomping]
[全部咀嚼]

10:33.025 --> 10:34.625
[all groaning]
[全都呻吟]

10:34.691 --> 10:37.658
- Eh--looks like your gym
has some new customers.
- 呃--看起来像你的健身房
有一些新客户。

10:37.725 --> 10:40.625
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

10:40.691 --> 10:43.225
- Somebody, let me out
of this thing already!
- 谁来放我出去吧
已经有这件事了！

10:43.291 --> 10:45.191
- [singing]
Home sweet home.
- [唱歌]
温馨的家。

10:45.258 --> 10:46.891
[customers chewing]
Hmm?
[顾客咀嚼]
嗯？

10:46.958 --> 10:48.925
[cheery music]
[欢快的音乐]

10:48.991 --> 10:51.425
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

10:51.525 --> 10:53.691
- Order up!
- 订购吧！

10:53.758 --> 10:56.125
- [chewing]
- [咀嚼]

10:56.191 --> 10:59.825
- [sighs happily]
Everything's just how I left it.
- [高兴地叹气]
一切都还是我离开时的样子。

11:02.525 --> 11:05.525
[light twangy music]
[轻快的鼻音音乐]

11:05.525 --> 11:12.625
* *
**
**
**

**